"""Mantle message processor.

Houses the engine-version-specific behaviour for Mantle, kept separate from the
base :class:`rasa.core.processor.MessageProcessor` (CALM v1 / NLU) so that neither
path carries the other's branches. Instances are created by
:func:`rasa.core.processor.create_message_processor`, which selects this subtype
when a model's engine version is Mantle.
"""

